			<Property name="Id" value="UI_EXPED_14_LORE3" />
			<Property name="English" value="Here follows the testament of Liquidator #3813G of the &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Vanguard&lt;&gt;!&#xA;...&#xA;I have followed this vile brood across planet and moon, from star to star and sector to sector. And now you do too.&#xA;I have done what was asked. I have done my part, and now my life and theirs are intertwined. Vanguard and brood, hunter and hunter. A dance to the death..." />
