			<Property name="Id" value="UI_EXPED_14_LORE4" />
			<Property name="English" value="Here follows the testament of Liquidator #3813G of the &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Vanguard&lt;&gt;!&#xA;...&#xA;This infestation was stubborn. I had to place the plasma charges by hand, plunging myself into the viscera of the nest.&#xA;I did so without fear. I knew those who follow would do their part.&#xA;But at its heart, surrounded by grubs, I was submerged in the hive's jelly. It was soft. It was warm. It was a home.&#xA;I could not place the charges. I could not do my part.&#xA;I am shamed. And now you have done my part for me." />
