			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S12_POI_3_RES" />
			<Property name="English" value="I cannot help but gasp at the sheer size of the titan dwelling within this memory. Illusion or not, I am glad it is only bones...&#xA;As my initial surprise fades, I find myself wondering - why is this creature dead? Why not choose to remember it in the glory of life? And what could kill such a being...&#xA;But the bones do not answer my questions. They merely exist." />
