			<Property name="English" value="Crashed sentinel interceptors can be found on &lt;SPECIAL&gt;dissonant&lt;&gt; planets. Once located, the ship can be salvaged and made pilotable.&#xA;&#xA;Systems with dissonant planets are marked in the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Galaxy Map&lt;&gt;. Scan worlds with the starship's &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Scanner&lt;&gt; (&lt;IMG&gt;SHIPSCAN&lt;&gt;) to locate specific dissonant planets.&#xA;Search the &lt;STELLAR&gt;Combat Supply Barrels&lt;&gt; dropped by the corrupted sentinel forces on dissonant worlds to acquire an &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Echo Locator&lt;&gt;, which will lead to a nearby &lt;STELLAR&gt;Harmonic Camp&lt;&gt;. Defeating all corrupted sentinel reinforcements will always reveal a Harmonic Camp.&#xA;These abandoned camps can be searched for coordinates that lead directly to an &lt;SPECIAL&gt;interceptor crash site&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Alternatively, engaging and defeating sentinel interceptors in space combat will cause deployment of a &lt;FUEL&gt;Sentinel Capital Ship&lt;&gt;. Defeating this powerful vessel can lead directly to an interceptor crash site. Engage in criminal activity while in your starship to attract sentinel attention.&#xA;See the &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Space Combat&lt;&gt; entry in the 'Combat' section of the Guide for further details." />
