		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="PIRATE_GUILD_DESC">
			<Property name="Id" value="PIRATE_GUILD_DESC" />
			<Property name="English" value="In some star systems, the dominant local authority has been &lt;VAL_ON&gt;overthrown&lt;&gt; by rebel outlaw forces. Such outlaw systems see unusually high levels of &lt;FUEL&gt;conflict&lt;&gt;, due to the lack of punishment for preying on trader starships. This presents a risk to those wishing to trade, but a substantial &lt;STELLAR&gt;opportunity&lt;&gt; to those who wish to engage in piracy themselves.&#xA;&#xA;Profitable acts of piracy include the smuggling of &lt;SPECIAL&gt;contraband&lt;&gt;, raiding &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;freighters&lt;&gt; and &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;traders&lt;&gt;, or performing missions for a &lt;STELLAR&gt;Bounty Master&lt;&gt; aboard a rebel station." />
