			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_ROBOMISS_17_REFUSE" />
			<Property name="English" value="When I returned to the Anomaly, Nada stiffened, looking at me with concern.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Are you well, Friend-Entity? }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I told Nada of my encounter with the Atlas.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Atlas-Falsity was afraid? Nada has not considered this possibility. Curious. But Traveller should be wary. Atlas-False-Entity is a liar.&#xA;Purple-lattice exists where it cannot. Challenges the Atlas-Falsity. Proves it is not deity. Nada always knew.&#xA;But Nada had not realised... do you have the purple-lattice here? }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Nada took the purple crystal, holding it gently in their palm. A shudder ran through their carapace, their facial lights blinking erratically. They were lost in some private emotion, some memory. I did not interrupt. &#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ She was home, once. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;...&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ May Nada keep this, Friend-Entity? }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I refused. Nada looked crestfallen. They quickly composed themself, speaking coldly.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Perhaps Traveller is correct.&#xA;&#xA;Nada will forget. There. It is already forgotten. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;...&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ The Builder-Entities, the purple-lattice... Nada does not think there is cause for fear. Not for us. For Atlas-Falsity, perhaps. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Nada's lights blinked, just once.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ And Nada does not quarantine our friendship. There is plenty. Make your path forward, Traveller. Make friends. It is your way.&#xA;&#xA;Nada and Polo will always be here. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
