			<Property name="English" value="The stars begin to slip as my mind focuses on a single point. With a rush, I am returned to life in a brand new body.&#xA;Everything is dark. I try to move, but every fibre of my being is deeply unfamiliar. Nonetheless, I feel a raw strength ripple through my core.&#xA;With a roar, I erupt out of the darkness. I soar above the planet now, colossal, writhing. I am magnificent. A titan.&#xA;&lt;AUDIO&gt;MUS_Corrupted_Lp_Stop_Fast&lt;&gt;&lt;AUDIO&gt;Portal_Jump_Story_End&lt;&gt;&lt;MOOD&gt;Positive&lt;&gt;All too soon, the song of atlantid fades, and the monolith returns me to my own body." />
