			<Property name="English" value="The monolith resonated as the &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Atlantideum&lt;&gt; seeped within its core.&#xA;&#xA;A voice, impossibly old, impossibly low, was magnified as the stone vibrated. The feeling was overwhelming. My eyes began to swim.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&quot;%ALIEN_TEXT%&quot;&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I blinked to clear my vision. As my eyes re-opened, I found myself afloat in a waveless purple sea. The sky glowed.&#xA;&#xA;The voice had become a chant, its words filling the water around me.&#xA;&#xA;In the distance, walls of crystal erupted from the depths. Fountains of lilac-tinted water sparkled in the light, crystal foam arcing through the air as the sea was displaced.&#xA;&#xA;One by one, mile-high spires were thrown from the core. It was beautiful. &#xA;&#xA;One by one, these cliffs began to close in on me. And then I realised. I turned and began to swim, but they were coming for me. &#xA;&#xA;I felt the bubbles surround me. The water beneath me vibrated, and I felt myself start to sink. I heard the roar as the crystal raced though the sea. I -&#xA;&#xA;At the moment the crystal wall overtook my body, I was released. It was done." />
